  m_Name: Liv
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: SafeHaven::ResidentDefinition
  id: expedition.liv
  displayName: Liv
  description: Rune Scholar from the expedition into the Unquiet Forest. Lost when the waystone connection broke.
  portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a68b4df3b2228c44aa638d42833cedec, type: 3}
  rescueLine: The stones broke along a line. A line! Do you understand what that means?
  arrivalLine: Your ward is a promise too. Did anyone tell you?
  welcomeLine: The stones broke along a line, straight as a chalk mark. Stones don't break straight. Somebody drew that line, and I want to know who.
  fallenLine: Write it down. Somebody has to write it down.
  fightLines:
    spotted: []
    behindYou: []
    hurt: []
    won: []
    helpedUp: []
  model: {fileID: 8547817121170689845, guid: bfe50e41c99770f4d875f8e1ec6301cc, type: 3}
  raidCompanion: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 60d284aaf3c06f24fba9e928940c43c5, type: 2}
  memoryLines: []
  returningLines: []
  jobs:
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: e68d6cc3611cddc4ab1e165871f1a4ae, type: 2}
  questLine:
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 933d1de4d30ba9449985ab8bd2757b7e, type: 2}
    text: Runes aren't magic. They're promises the woods remember. Give me the work, and at Ingrid's cauldron I'll show you how to cut one for the road.
    acceptText: Show me.
    waitingText: Cut a Wayfinder Rune at the Cauldron. Ingrid will lend it.
    askText: 
    thanksText: 
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5715fae8bad44dd4b84dbdb44b2d7c38, type: 2}
    text: Ingrid showed you the safe marks. I'll show you where new ones come from. Ask me how, then cut your first at the altar.
    acceptText: Teach me the marks.
    waitingText: Ask me about enchanting, then carve a mark at the Purification Altar.
    askText: 
    thanksText: 
  questLineDone: 
